 Locomotion system my friend made, friend is Yellow44, where you can swing with webs as a spider may do.\nI also made this because I enjoy to make people happy and want people to have a safe space to play in with other people.\nPlay now!\nGod bless.\n\nYellow44 was here...", "short_description": "Just a game where you swing a round, jump and run from Magma Bots.\n\nWhy you should play:\nThere is so much to do for example, \n- Go on a shopping spree\n- Play tag with friends\n- Do sick parkour\n- Join the Discord: https://discord.gg/Ktx9NvbaCX\n- Etc.\n\nPlay now!\nGod bless.\n\nYellow44 is watching..."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rcprivacypolicy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Zane2evil", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/robocwebsite/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "26460322993641535"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1762170611444747"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1762170611444747"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1785690000, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1762170611444747"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typ